OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French delves into the
OL,6,     Glife and music of the Flemish
OL,7,     Gcomposer and publisher Tielman
OL,8,     GSusato, who was active in Antwerp
OL,9,     Gin the mid-16th century.
OL,10,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from the Chapel of St John's
OL,12,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,13,     GMoran, Cecilia McDowall, Howells
OL,14,     Gand Durufle.
OL,15,G1900FThe Kershaw Tapes
OL,16,     GAndy Kershaw introduces his own
OL,17,     Gcassette recordings of music from
OL,18,     Ghis travels in Africa during the
OL,19,     G1980s.
